meta {
  name: Sync IGDB Data (Stream)
  type: http
  seq: 31
}

post {
  url: {{backendUrl}}/api/igdb-sync/stream
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  SSE endpoint (media_type: text/event-stream): looks up the top IGDB
  match for every personal entry that lacks a genre or description and
  fills in what is missing (genre, description, trailer, beat-times -
  never overwriting existing values; Steam-linked titles also lose
  trademark symbols). Emits a `progress` event ({"processed", "total"})
  per entry, then a `done` event with the updated entries, or an `error`
  event.

  Bruno returns the raw event-stream body once the connection closes.
  Run auth/Login first.

  503 if neither the caller nor the server has IGDB credentials
}
